		"player":{
			"P000":{
				"desc":"A kind-hearted young man who grew up in a remote village. Having saved his village from monsters when he was a child, he vows to become strong.",
				"name":"Shiren"
			},
			"P001":{
				"desc":"The young head of a prestigious noble family. Possessing both elegance and a strong sense of responsibility, he aspires to reform the corrupt aristocratic society. He is calm but also possesses a passionate side.",
				"name":"Ashley"
			},
			"P002":{
				"desc":"Born into a prestigious family of lancers in the royal army, he left home to work as a mercenary and bodyguard.",
				"name":"Kiji"
			},
			"P003":{
				"desc":"A genius magician born in a forest dense with magical energy. From a young age, her magical power tended to run wild, and she has a delicate constitution where her emotions are directly linked to her power.",
				"name":"Mireille"
			},
			"P004":{
				"desc":"A righteous outlaw who grew up in the slums and has survived since childhood through agility and quick thinking.",
				"name":"Kai"
			},
			"P005":{
				"desc":"A long-lived elf girl who lives in a deep forest. She possesses the ability to hear the voices of nature and spirits, and was raised as a guardian of the forest.",
				"name":"Leafa"
			},
			"P006":{
				"desc":"A troubadour who weaves stories while traveling. He grew up in a port town tavern and has learned songs and folklore from all over the world.",
				"name":"Rude"
			},
			"P007":{
				"desc":"A dancer born in a desert oasis city. From a young age, she has captivated travelers with her dance and song.",
				"name":"Fiona"
			},
			"P008":{
				"desc":"An orphan raised in a desolate arena, he continues his journey in search of true strength, guided by the teachings of the master who took him in.",
				"name":"Ranga"
			},
			"P009":{
				"desc":"Born into a clan of ninjas living hidden in a misty mountain village, he will throw himself into any danger for the sake of his mission, and will even break the rules to protect his comrades.",
				"name":"Shigure"
			},
			"P010":{
				"desc":"An elite born into a family of knights who protect the kingdom. He has a strict personality, but is kinder to the weak than anyone else.",
				"name":"Clarice"
			},
			"P011":{
				"desc":"Born into a family of traveling merchants, he is an experienced merchant who has traveled to various places since childhood. He values ​​not only profit but also human connections, and conducts business with honesty and integrity with everyone he deals with.",
				"name":"Roche"
			},
			"P012":{
				"desc":"A young man from the Koropokkuru, a small tribe that lives in the northern forests. They are a people who live in harmony with nature and possess the ability to communicate with plants and animals.",
				"name":"Pokkle"
			}
		},
